{
  "_comment": [
    "Vagaro is the single source of truth for the treatment menu: the daily sync",
    "mirrors her live catalogue (categories, services, prices, descriptions).",
    "widgets: stateless permanent booking-widget URLs. They scope which category",
    "the booking modal opens on. Regenerate in Vagaro -> Settings -> Booking Widget.",
    "'all' is the unscoped widget - the catalogue source for the sync, and the",
    "fallback link for any category without a scoped widget of its own.",
    "categoryWidgets: normalized Vagaro category name -> widgets key, for row links.",
    "hide: normalized category/service names that are bookable line items but not",
    "menu material (fees, internal bookkeeping rows)."
  ],
  "widgets": {
    "injectables": "https://www.vagaro.com/Users/BusinessWidget.aspx?",
    "lips": "https://www.vagaro.com/Users/BusinessWidget.aspx?",
    "dissolve": null,
    "micro": "https://www.vagaro.com/Users/BusinessWidget.aspx?",
    "peels": "https://www.vagaro.com/Users/BusinessWidget.aspx?",
    "facials": "https://www.vagaro.com/Users/BusinessWidget.aspx?",
    "promos": "https://www.vagaro.com/Users/BusinessWidget.aspx?",
    "all": "https://www.vagaro.com/Users/BusinessWidget.aspx?"
  },
  "categoryWidgets": {
    "injectables": "injectables",
    "fillers": "lips",
    "dissolve filler": "dissolve",
    "microneedling": "micro",
    "chemical peels": "peels",
    "skincare richmond tx location": "facials",
    "monthly promotions and discounts": "promos",
    "bridal glow menus": "promos"
  },
  "promoCards": {
    "_comment": [
      "The 'This month at Ameze' cards mirror one Vagaro category, so she never",
      "maintains them by hand: title, price and flyer art all come from Vagaro,",
      "and the daily sync republishes when any of them change.",
      "category: normalized Vagaro category name that feeds the cards.",
      "fallbackImage: used only when a promotion has no photo in Vagaro — the",
      "cards are image-led, so a card still renders rather than failing to publish.",
      "max: she keeps last month's promotion up alongside the new one, so this",
      "sits at the grid's ceiling of 8 rather than a tight number — a promotion",
      "that silently failed to appear is the exact problem this sync removes.",
      "Anything past 8 stays on the menu tab."
    ],
    "category": "monthly promotions and discounts",
    "fallbackImage": "img/media/injectables.jpg",
    "max": 8
  },
  "hide": [
    "no show fee"
  ]
}
